{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["Kidou Senshi SD Gundam","A collection of short parodies of the Mobile Suit Gundam saga. Episode 1 pokes fun at key events that occurred during the One Year War. In episode 2, Amuro, Kamille and Judau fight over who runs the better pension when Char comes in to crash their party. Episode 3 is the SD Olympics, an array of athletic events pitting man with mobile suit."],"ja":["機動戦士SDガンダム",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":2303,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-2302","ids":{"shikimori":2302,"mal":2302,"anilist":2302,"kodik":"serial-27582"},"kodikIds":["serial-27582"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27582":"2020-07-09T06:18:54Z"},"title":"Мобильный воин СД Гандам","originalTitle":"Kidou Senshi SD Gundam","alt":"Mobile Suit SD Gundam Mk. I 機動戦士SDガンダム","description":"Сборник коротких пародий на сагу «Мобильный воин ГАНДАМ». Первый эпизод высмеивает ключевые события Войны за Одну неделю. Во втором эпизоде Амуро Рэй, Камиль Бидан и Джудо Ашта спорят, чей пансионат лучше, а тут ещё и Чар Азнабль заявляется, чтобы испортить им веселье. Третий эпизод — это SD-Олимпиада, набор спортивных состязаний, где человек соревнуется на пару с мобильным доспехом.","year":1988,"type":"SPECIAL","genres":["Комедия","Фантастика","меха","пародия"],"rating":6.25,"popularity":2210,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[2303],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/2302/342e3ac2748962eca0d746a17e482bf7.jpeg","width":310,"height":399},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/a971a4e5c29569926645b60022c097f44d83ba28.jpg","width":720,"height":544}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":0,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1161","dubId":"1161","label":"Azazel","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-27582","translationId":"1161","url":